1
00:00:00,570 --> 00:00:01,860
(Zack:)We're going
to be late.

2
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:04,480
(Sheldon:)I'm pacing nervously.

3
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,710
(Leonard:)You're jogging.

4
00:00:05,710 --> 00:00:09,050
(Sheldon:)This is how the
Flash paces.

5
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:11,720
Just chill out, Sheldon.

6
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:14,650
(Sheldon:)I'm not Sheldon.
I'm the Flash.

7
00:00:14,650 --> 00:00:16,260
(Sheldon:)And now I'm going
to the Grand Canyon

8
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:17,560
(Sheldon:)to scream in frustration.

9
00:00:17,560 --> 00:00:19,790
(Sheldon:)I'm back.

10
00:00:22,330 --> 00:00:25,560
(Howard:)I'm Batman.

11
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:27,770
(Sheldon:)Oh, I hardly think so.

12
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:30,300
(Sheldon:)The real caped crusader calls
his crime-fighting cohorts

13
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:31,400
(Sheldon:)when he's running late.

14
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,810
(Howard:)I had to walk.

15
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:36,880
(Howard:)I couldn't get Raj
on the back of my scooter.

16
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,720
(Raj:)I've said this before,
and I'll say it again.

17
00:00:46,720 --> 00:00:49,890
(Raj:)Aquaman sucks.

18
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:52,460
(Zack:)Look up in the sky.
It's a bird. It's a plane.

19
00:00:54,290 --> 00:00:57,060
(Zack:)I forget the rest.

20
00:00:58,160 --> 00:01:02,030
(Penny:)All right. Let's get
this thing over with.

